      "description": "Serial number: AV26-1133 Date: November 6, 2026 As of November 6, 2026, SonicWall is affected by a vulnerability in the following product: SonicOS prior to 7.3.4-7013 prior to 8.2.2-8015 SonicWall indicates that CVE-2026-19868 is being exploited. On November 6, 2026, Cybersecurity and Infrastructure Security Agency (CISA) added CVE-2026-19868 to their Known Exploited Vulnerabilities (KEV) Catalog. SonicWall SonicOS Affected By Multiple Vulnerabilities SonicWall Security Advisory CISA KEV: CVE-2026-19868",
